+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0+
+/*
+ * FIPS-180-2 compliant SHA-512 and SHA-384 implementation
+ *
+ * SHA-512 code by Jean-Luc Cooke <jlcooke@certainkey.com>
